OL,3,GNEWSAYoung dad says more support needed
OL,4,Afor new fathers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young dad who struggled with becoming
OL,7,Fa father at 18 says more support is
OL,8,Fneeded to help men bond and become role
OL,9,Fmodels for their children.
OL,11,FJosh, from County Durham, now 22, says
OL,12,Fhis life and relationship with his twin
OL,13,Fdaughters has been transformed by
OL,14,Fsupport that he said should be offered
OL,15,Fto more men.
OL,17,FBut he also believes the government
OL,18,Fneeds to increase the amount of
OL,19,Fpaternity leave on offer to new dads,
OL,20,Fand ensure employers offer flexible
OL,21,Fworking.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
